notice Notice="Welcome to Havenford. Guild Street is north of the square."
news 1 NewsBuf="Training halls stand north of Havenford Square."
news 2 NewsBuf="Roads north of the city remain safe through the frontier post."
news 3 NewsBuf="Beyond the warning sign, beasts wander in the meadow."
news 4 NewsBuf="The northwest Aether Observatory welcomes apprentice magic-users."
news 5 NewsBuf="The southwest keep offers locks, traps and ascending thief challenges."
