special 12 Role=smith Greeting="Smith: I can repair your worn equipment." Stock= Stagger= Trains=
special 13 Role=bar Greeting="Innkeeper: The city is safe; danger lies up the north road. Take the square's east exit, then go north through the North Gate." Stock= Stagger=1,2,10,13 Trains=
