desc 1 1 Text="1/You are in Havenford Refuge. The square and guild signs are east./"
desc 1 2 Text="1/You are in Havenford Square. Guilds north, shops south, North Gate east./"
desc 1 3 Text="1/You are on Guild Street. Training halls flank the cobbled street./"
desc 1 4 Text="1/You are in the Hall of Blades. Practice swords ring against shields./"
desc 1 5 Text="1/You are in the Scout Lodge. Maps and unstrung bows cover the walls./"
desc 1 6 Text="1/You are in the Academy of Sparks. Apprentices study quiet spells./"
desc 1 7 Text="1/You are in the Lantern Chapel. The Graveward path leaves west./"
desc 1 8 Text="1/You are in the Shadow School. Chalk marks outline a practice lock./"
desc 1 9 Text="1/You are in the Hall of Stewards. Instructors teach worldcraft./"
desc 1 10 Text="1/You are on Market Lane. A store lies east and a smithy west./"
desc 2 1 Text="1/You are in the Provisioner. Food and basic gear fill wooden shelves./"
desc 2 2 Text="1/You are in the Smithy. A friendly smith tests a repaired blade./"
desc 2 3 Text="1/You are in the River Inn. Soup simmers in the common hearth./"
desc 2 4 Text="1/You are at the Notice Kiosk. Fresh notices hang under an awning./"
desc 2 5 Text="1/You are in the Exchange. A pawnbroker sorts simple trinkets./"
desc 2 6 Text="1/You are in a public garden. The North Gate and the north road lie north./"
desc 2 7 Text="1/You are at Havenford North Gate. Guards wave travellers through./"
desc 2 8 Text="1/You are on a calm road past the city walls. Farms lie north./"
desc 2 9 Text="1/You are at the orchard crossroads. The city is south./"
desc 2 10 Text="1/You are beside a quiet orchard. No danger seems close./"
desc 3 1 Text="1/You are on a sunlit farm track. A milestone points north./"
desc 3 2 Text="1/You are at the Frontier Warning Post. Read the sign before north./"
desc 3 3 Text="1/You are in the meadow margin. Small tracks cross the grass./"
desc 3 4 Text="1/You are in the willow meadow. A stream divides the reeds./"
desc 3 5 Text="1/You are on a ferny trail. Rustling comes from the undergrowth./"
desc 3 6 Text="1/You are at a shallow ford. The far bank rises into wooded hills./"
desc 3 7 Text="1/You are at the old charcoal kiln. Ash covers the clearing./"
desc 3 8 Text="1/You are among the low pine hills. Broken stone walls emerge./"
desc 3 9 Text="1/You are at an abandoned campsite. A cold pot rests by the fire./"
desc 3 10 Text="1/You are beside the ruined mill. Its wheel creaks in the wind./"
desc 4 1 Text="1/You are on the ridge path. The old watchtower is visible north./"
desc 4 2 Text="1/You are in the bracken ravine. A narrow pass climbs east./"
desc 4 3 Text="1/You are at the tower approach. Loose stones shift underfoot./"
desc 4 4 Text="1/You are in the outer tower yard. A broken bell hangs overhead./"
desc 4 5 Text="1/You are inside the watchtower. Stairs climb into shadow./"
desc 4 6 Text="1/You are in the watchtower loft. Wind whistles through the roof./"
desc 4 7 Text="1/You are at the hill shrine. Smooth stones line a dry spring./"
desc 4 8 Text="1/You are on the western sheep path. The pasture is quiet./"
desc 4 9 Text="1/You are in the sheep pasture. The farmer smiles from a distance./"
desc 4 10 Text="1/You are in the guild library. Books explain the roads ahead./"
desc 5 1 Text="1/You are on the eastern promenade. The garden is west, a yard north./"
desc 5 2 Text="1/You are at the training yard. Straw dummies stand in rows. Exit south./"
desc 6 1 Text="1/DANGER AHEAD! Monsters roam north of this post. Turn back if unready./"
desc 6 2 Text="1/A kindly old caretaker gestures toward the nearby training halls./"
desc 6 3 Text="1/A small rat snuffles among the roots./"
desc 6 4 Text="1/A nervous crow hops from branch to branch./"
desc 6 5 Text="1/A lean stray dog watches the path warily./"
desc 6 6 Text="1/A fox with rust-colored fur stands in the grass./"
desc 6 7 Text="1/A rough-looking highway thief grips a dull knife./"
desc 6 8 Text="1/A battered skeleton stumbles through the ruined stones./"
desc 6 9 Text="1/A hungry grey wolf peers from the brush./"
desc 6 10 Text="1/An armored raider guards a crumbling stone passage./"
desc 7 1 Text="1/A restless tower sentinel drags a dented spear./"
desc 7 2 Text="1/A scarred bandit captain wears a faded blue cloak./"
desc 7 3 Text="1/A carved wooden sign points south to the safety of Havenford./"
desc 8 1 Text="1/You are in the Chapel Cloister. Graveward signs point west./"
desc 8 2 Text="1/You are on the west pilgrim road. Quiet fields surround the path./"
desc 8 3 Text="1/You are at the memorial garden. Names are carved on low stones./"
desc 8 4 Text="1/You are at the Graveward Watch Post. The cemetery is west./"
desc 8 5 Text="1/You stand at the Graveward Warning Gate. Read the posted warning./"
desc 8 6 Text="1/You are among neglected graves. Loose bones shift in the soil./"
desc 8 7 Text="1/You are on the cemetery path. A thin mist hangs above the stones./"
desc 8 8 Text="1/You are beside an open grave. Something scrapes beneath the earth./"
desc 8 9 Text="1/You are before an old mausoleum. Stone steps lead down./"
desc 8 10 Text="1/You are in the mausoleum hall. Pale figures drift in the dark./"
desc 9 1 Text="1/You are in the ossuary passage. Bone piles line the walls./"
desc 9 2 Text="1/You are in the bone guard chamber. Ancient armor gleams faintly./"
desc 9 3 Text="1/You are in the deepest crypt. A cold throne dominates the vault./"
desc 9 4 Text="1/You are in a sealed side chapel. A silver bell hangs over an altar./"
desc 9 5 Text="1/You are on the graveyard overlook. Havenford lies to the east./"
desc 9 6 Text="1/UNDEAD AHEAD! West of this gate is unsafe. Clerics: return east to heal./"
desc 9 7 Text="1/A brittle skeleton lurches forward with empty eye sockets./"
desc 9 8 Text="1/A dim spirit wanders silently between the grave markers./"
desc 9 9 Text="1/A grave guardian in rotted mail rises from the shadows./"
desc 9 10 Text="1/A bone knight stands motionless with a notched sword./"
desc 10 1 Text="1/A cold crypt wight points one skeletal finger at the living./"
desc 10 2 Text="1/A votive silver token engraved with the chapel's sun emblem./"
desc 10 3 Text="1/A polished shard of pale moonstone, cool in the palm./"
desc 10 4 Text="1/A silver reliquary bearing a faded protective blessing./"
desc 11 1 Text="1/You are on the south-west lane. A ruined keep rises beyond the fields./"
desc 11 2 Text="1/You are on the old causeway. The keep stands to the west./"
desc 11 3 Text="1/You are at the keep's warning board. The gate is west./"
desc 11 4 Text="1/You stand in Lockspire courtyard. Entry to the keep lies west./"
desc 11 5 Text="1/You are in the ground-floor entry. Practice corridors lead west./"
desc 11 6 Text="1/You are in the novice lock hall. Two doors lead to practice chambers./"
desc 11 7 Text="1/You are in the brass-lock chamber. A low chest rests on a bench./"
desc 11 8 Text="1/You are in the needle-lock chamber. A chest bears a tiny keyhole./"
desc 11 9 Text="1/You are at the first stairwell. Steps climb to the second floor./"
desc 11 10 Text="1/You are on the second landing. A corridor runs west./"
desc 12 1 Text="1/You are in the warded corridor. Faint holes mark the stonework./"
desc 12 2 Text="1/You are in the old records room. Shelves surround a heavy chest./"
desc 12 3 Text="1/You are in the armory vault. A steel-bound strongbox waits here./"
desc 12 4 Text="1/You are at the second stairwell. Steps climb to the third floor./"
desc 12 5 Text="1/You are on the third landing. Fine locks adorn two dark doors./"
desc 12 6 Text="1/You are in the master lock hall. Dust outlines hidden trigger plates./"
desc 12 7 Text="1/You are in the jewel chamber. A carved chest stands under a lamp./"
desc 12 8 Text="1/You are in the artificer's treasury. Complex mechanisms hum softly./"
desc 12 9 Text="1/You are at the roof stair. The final flight rises above./"
desc 12 10 Text="1/You are on the battlement. The city and Graveward lie below./"
desc 13 1 Text="1/You are in the crowning vault. A final chest awaits a master thief./"
desc 13 2 Text="1/THIEVES: This keep has locks and traps. Every staircase stays open./"
desc 13 3 Text="1/Begin with the first floor. Locks and trap risk rise as you climb./"
desc 13 4 Text="1/A battered practice chest with a simple latch and blunt trap pin./"
desc 13 5 Text="1/A narrow strongbox with carefully fitted brass mechanisms./"
desc 13 6 Text="1/A reinforced coffer with hidden spring needles./"
desc 13 7 Text="1/A steel vault chest engraved with winding geometric lines./"
desc 13 8 Text="1/A jewel casket with a subtle pressure-release catch./"
desc 13 9 Text="1/A masterwork clockwork chest with intricate internal tumblers./"
desc 13 10 Text="1/A crown-shaped iron chest surrounded by concealed trigger slots./"
desc 14 1 Text="1/You are on Scholar's Walk. A sign points west to the observatory./"
desc 14 2 Text="1/You are in the arcane garden. Quiet lanterns float above the path./"
desc 14 3 Text="1/You are at the novice colonnade. Lecture rooms stand east and south./"
desc 14 4 Text="1/You are on the crystal causeway. The observatory looms west./"
desc 14 5 Text="1/You are at the Aether Warning Gate. Danger lies north./"
desc 14 6 Text="1/You are in the spark meadow. Weak magical motes flicker around you./"
desc 14 7 Text="1/You are in the mirror thicket. Strange lights dart through the trees./"
desc 14 8 Text="1/You stand before a shattered arch. Arcane echoes pulse beyond it./"
desc 14 9 Text="1/You are in the broken observatory. Stairs spiral upward./"
desc 14 10 Text="1/You are in the stargazer's loft. A broken telescope points skyward./"
desc 15 1 Text="1/You are in the upper prism hall. Light scatters from cracked glass./"
desc 15 2 Text="1/You are in the high aether chamber. Reality seems thin here./"
desc 15 3 Text="1/You are in the spell library. Manuals teach safe magical practice./"
desc 15 4 Text="1/You are in the darkened study. A lantern sits beside the door./"
desc 15 5 Text="1/You are in the null-magic room. Enchantments fall silent here./"
desc 15 6 Text="1/You are in the apprentice workshop. Test equipment covers the tables./"
desc 15 7 Text="1/A small flickering mote drifts just above the ground./"
desc 15 8 Text="1/A translucent sprite hums around a cluster of flowers./"
desc 15 9 Text="1/A crackling spark elemental glows like a burning ember./"
desc 15 10 Text="1/A shimmering mirror shade distorts the air around it./"
desc 16 1 Text="1/A prismatic guardian stands between shards of colored glass./"
desc 16 2 Text="1/A wild aether warden crackles with unstable magic./"
desc 16 3 Text="1/DANGER AHEAD! Arcane creatures roam north. Return east to train./"
desc 16 4 Text="1/A note reads: In the dark study, USE LANTERN. Magic fails in the null room./"
desc 16 5 Text="1/An old apprentice's scroll, neatly marked with the heal spell./"
desc 16 6 Text="1/A polished charm bearing the sigil of the observatory./"
desc 16 7 Text="1/A blue crystal that pulses with stored energy./"
desc 16 8 Text="1/A glass prism containing a faint sliver of starlight./"
desc 16 9 Text="1/A brass lantern on a hook. USE it to light the study for a moment./"
